# SKINOVA Frontend Environment Variables
# If you want to connect real Google Sign-In via Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Create an OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Add Authorized JavaScript Origins: http://localhost:5173
# 3. Paste your client ID below and rename this file to .env (or add to .env)

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
